    <div class="step"><strong>Age 14–15</strong><br/><span class="muted">Web development, JavaScript, Python OOP, databases, and CRUD applications.</span></div>
    <div class="step"><strong>Age 15–16</strong><br/><span class="muted">Application development, APIs, algorithms, and competitive programming.</span></div>
    <div class="step"><strong>Age 16–17</strong><br/><span class="muted">Software development, AI/ML foundations, mobile development, and DevOps concepts.</span></div>
    <div class="step"><strong>Age 17–18</strong><br/><span class="muted">Specialization, open source, portfolio building, competitions, and preparation for further study.</span></div>
